          "comments": [
            {
              "originalPosition": 19,
              "body": "```suggestion\r\nAs per the SSLKEYLOGFILE specification {{!I-D.ietf-tls-keylogfile}}, this extension is intended for use in environments where TLS protects only test data. While the access it provides to TLS connections can be valuable for debugging during development, this mechanism MUST NOT be used in production environments. To minimize the risk of accidental activation in production, implementers SHOULD incorporate appropriate compile-time controls.\r\n```",
              "createdAt": "2024-10-20T19:07:28Z",
              "updatedAt": "2024-10-20T19:07:29Z"
